[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
The collectors send this host's S.M.A.R.T. and ZFS pool data to a Scrutiny
web server (hub) of the same version, which is not part of this package.

Set the hub's address and a name for this host in
%%PREFIX%%/etc/scrutiny/collector.yaml, which both collectors read:

  api:
    endpoint: 'http://scrutiny.example.org:8080'
  host:
    id: 'myhost'

Then run the collectors as root, e.g. from /etc/crontab:

  0  0  *  *  *  root  %%PREFIX%%/bin/scrutiny-collector-metrics run
  0  0  *  *  *  root  %%PREFIX%%/bin/scrutiny-collector-zfs run
EOM
}
]
